<article class="env-lemma" id="02PL">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02PL">Lemma <span data-tag="02PL">42.68.15</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a local ring with residue field $\kappa $. Let $(M, \varphi , \psi )$ be a $(2, 1)$-periodic complex over $R$. Assume that $M$ has finite length and that $(M, \varphi , \psi )$ is exact. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \det \nolimits _\kappa (M, \varphi , \psi ) \det \nolimits _\kappa (M, \psi , \varphi ) = 1.  \]
</div>
